      "message": "what does thread-safe mean in this context?\n\nIf two threads call `createSyncFenceFromFd` and they try to make `this.eglContext` current, will everything work as expected?",
      "revId": "c8bc1a98b496324706471371af8b3b4ff8c7e4af",
