      "writtenOn": "2026-06-22T19:38:20Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes! The entire createSyncFenceFromFd function body is wrapped in synchronized(lock) { ... }. If two threads call this simultaneously, they are serialized. Thread A will enter the block, swap its EGL context, perform the duplication, safely restore its original EGL context, and release the lock before Thread B is allowed to enter.",
